amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/572e2b76ca6dd8a46911e9e08c25ceae.poster.avif?t=1771587371\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/572e2b76ca6dd8a46911e9e08c25ceae.webm?t=1771587371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/572e2b76ca6dd8a46911e9e08c25ceae.mp4?t=1771587371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to become a legend of Rome?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a legionary, your mission is clear: <strong>expand the Empire's borders</strong> into hostile lands. Build your camp, manage resources, face barbarian tribes, and rise through the ranks to become a true military leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/a7ddb517fa5dc96b428b4b1849702bb0.poster.avif?t=1771587371\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/a7ddb517fa5dc96b428b4b1849702bb0.webm?t=1771587371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/a7ddb517fa5dc96b428b4b1849702bb0.mp4?t=1771587371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Survival and Management</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, build settlements, and secure supplies for your troops. <br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Customization and Progression</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your gear, train soldiers, and adapt your strategy to conquer new lands.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in intense tactical battles against ruthless enemies. <br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Dynamic and Unique World</strong> \u2013 Every game is different thanks to <strong>procedural generation</strong>, ensuring new challenges and opportunities in each expedition.<br>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Historical Authenticity</strong> \u2013 Experience ancient Rome with stunning realism, from military equipment to dialogues in Latin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summa Expeditionis is more than a game: <strong>it\u2019s a test of wit, courage, and leadership</strong>. Will you answer Rome\u2019s call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Play now in Early Access and help shape the ultimate Roman Empire experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.poster.avif?t=1771587371\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.webm?t=1771587371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/extras/eab21620cc9902e0a3a69490cfe280b6.mp4?t=1771587371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Lobico Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056200/4ff303a46b43e36626cffa1ecce642b2659bed74/header.jpg?t=1771587371","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2056200/235346176/bda0005fbb4ca22cdc2e67b9c6741b9673037fd9/1764165479/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764166837","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea